      5890 +#### Bug fixes                                               
      5891 +                                                             
      5892 +- **A categorical column in a model with no intercept lost a 
           +level.** With no                                             
      5893 +  intercept there is no baseline for a reference level to be 
           +measured against, so                                         
      5894 +  R codes the factor in full — one column per group, each coe
           +fficient that                                                
      5895 +  group's own mean. Both functions dropped the reference leve
           +l anyway, so                                                 
