           + every observation                                           
      5897 +  at the reference level to a fitted value of 0. On R's `Toot
           +hGrowth` that meant                                          
      5898 +  a residual sum of squares of 16056 against R's 3247, and an
           + R² of 0.35 against                                          
      5899 +  0.87. Where two categorical main effects appear with no int
           +ercept only the                                              
      5900 +  first is coded in full, as in R, since coding both would be
           + rank deficient.                                             
      5901 +                                                             
      5902 +- **An interaction involving a categorical column could not b
           +e built.** The                                               
      5903 +  interaction was looked up as a single column literally name
